WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.992
Today we will represent a place through organised sounds. Our work connects with

00:00:04.992 --> 00:00:06.835
Ghanaian and other African artists.

00:00:07.700 --> 00:00:10.111
List three sounds heard in the chosen setting.

00:00:11.700 --> 00:00:17.140
Assign each sound to a gentle vocal or body action. Record why your chosen technique

00:00:17.140 --> 00:00:18.228
suits the message.

00:00:19.033 --> 00:00:23.001
Perform the sounds in order to represent morning, afternoon or evening.
